# Local design references.
#
# `design/references/` holds the mood-board screenshots used while designing the
# UI. They are reference material, not GoMotion assets, so they must never be
# redistributed from this repository.
/design/references/

# Documentation policy for this repository.
#
# Only the top-level README.md is published. The rest of the handover
# documentation (docs/, CHANGELOG.md, AGENTS.md, prompts/, the GitHub
# templates) stays local to the working copy so the public repository is the
# app itself. The files are still on disk; they are simply not tracked.
# To publish one again: `git add -f docs/SOME_DOC.md`.
*.md
!/README.md
